OL,3,GNEWSAToddler dies following hit-and-run
OL,4,
OL,5,FA two-year-old boy has died after being
OL,6,Fstruck by a vehicle in County Limerick.
OL,8,FThe collision, involving a Jeep and the
OL,9,Fchild, happened in the Abbeycourt area
OL,10,Fof Rathkeale shortly before 16:00 BST
OL,11,Fon Saturday.
OL,13,FThe boy was taken to University
OL,14,FHospital Limerick with serious injuries
OL,15,Fbut was later pronounced dead.
OL,17,FGardai (Irish Police) said the vehicle
OL,18,Finvolved did not remain at the scene.
